WEBVTT

00:00:00.215 --> 00:00:04.518
Open “Photo capture” and enable it for this video part.

00:00:04.518 --> 00:00:11.310
Set the capture time, a short flash and a three-second hold.

00:00:11.310 --> 00:00:13.164
Move past “Capture at” to see the photo.

00:00:13.164 --> 00:00:22.340
Tilt the photo, make it smaller and add a white border.

00:00:22.340 --> 00:00:28.955
“Custom frame” lets you choose the area to photograph. Select “Apply” to confirm the crop.

00:00:28.955 --> 00:00:41.737
Start playback: the video flashes, holds a tilted photo with a border, then continues playing.
